/avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-02T09:53:25Z","updated_at":"2025-07-02T09:56:14Z","body":"Looks like this line is what breaks it:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/efb40c1524e54f2cf52f213e248bd0a7b790975a/scene/gui/spin_box.cpp#L199\n\nThis fails in this case, as the calculated result is `1.1` which is not less or equal to value + epsilon:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/efb40c1524e54f2cf52f213e248bd0a7b790975a/scene/gui/spin_box.cpp#L198\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/efb40c1524e54f2cf52f213e248bd0a7b790975a/scene/gui/range.cpp#L142-L144\n\nSo it calls `_calc_value`, which returns `1.1`, then it checks against the original value, `1`","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3027217423/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]